            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_water_wardens",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "glass_havva_feed_told",
            "onFailure": "glass_havva_feed_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_key",
          "text": "The key to the grating. I want the far end of that channel.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "cistern_key"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:cistern_key"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_water_wardens",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "glass_havva_key_gave",
            "onFailure": "glass_havva_key_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_cut_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Cut.” She is definite. “One rock, hollowed. And the tool marks run the wrong way for anyone standing on the floor of it, which I have pointed out to four generations of people who did not want to hear it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "glass_cistern_cut"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_cut_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_cut_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_cut_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_feed_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It does not.” She lets that sit. “There is a channel out and no channel in. I have been down there with a lamp more times than anybody and I am telling you there is no way in.” A shrug. “Which does raise the question of what was going out.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "glass_cistern_feed"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_feed_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_feed_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_feed_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_key_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She takes it off the ring at once, which is startling. “Three hundred years of keepers and not one of us has had a reason. Go on. If it is nothing I would like to be told it is nothing.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "cistern_key",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:cistern_key",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_key_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_havva_key_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Not while I am the keeper,” she says, and her hand is on the ring. “Come back when you can tell me what is at the far end.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_havva_key_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
